@cli/code-reviewers I’d like to contribute a small fix here: add `(none)` as the first issue-type choice, leave the type unset when selected, and preserve selection of real types. The wording would match the milestone picker.

Would this scope be welcome as an external contribution? If so, could you confirm the acceptance criteria and add `help wanted`?

I have a local fix with regression coverage. I noticed #14448 was closed unmerged, so I wanted to check before opening another PR.
